WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.875
- DESHAUN, STOP LIKING JERSEY SWAPS AND LET ME IN.

00:00:03.291 --> 00:00:04.625
Front office told me to give you this.

00:00:05.291 --> 00:00:07.000
- How do I FORCE them to trade me?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.500
- JAMES HARDEN ISSUES HEARTFELT TWEET TO HOUSTON.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.375
- I have to speak to The Beard.

00:00:14.291 --> 00:00:16.000
- THIS STOP IS…DIAMOND HEIGHTS.

00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:18.666
- Before you enter, we have a few unwritten rules—

00:00:19.291 --> 00:00:21.250
- That is why we don’t leave Gridiron Heights—

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.041
 - NOW ENTERING...HARDWOOD HILLS.

00:00:23.916 --> 00:00:26.791
- Whoaaaa. Athletes get to just go wherever they want.

00:00:26.791 --> 00:00:28.916
- Too…much…autonomy…

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.125
- Oh, great. More new people.

00:00:33.125 --> 00:00:34.791
- KYRIE, I SWEAR. I DON’T KNOW THESE GUYS.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.875
- IF WE’RE A SUPERTEAM, WHY DON’T I FEEL SUPER?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.500
- So you want to cause a scene in Houston?

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.166
Now publicly insult your teammates.

00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:48.625
- What?

00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:49.541
Uhh...

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:50.125
- Do it.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.875
- Uh, J.J. Watt’s head is too small for his body.

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:53.500
[Gasps]

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.916
- Look, I'm sorry. I can't do this. J.J.'s head is perfect.

00:00:56.541 --> 00:00:57.416
I guess I’m trapped.

00:00:57.541 --> 00:00:57.875
Ahh!

00:01:02.708 --> 00:01:07.000
- Unwritten rule #34, If anyone is having a really good day, no one can talk about it. 

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.291
No ordering a Grand Slam from Denny’s if you’ve already eaten that day.

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:12.166
No enjoying your job out loud.

00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:17.041
If someone’s car has hit every green light on main street, 
they get to run stop signs to keep it going.

00:01:17.208 --> 00:01:19.958
If your neighbor’s music is too loud, you get to peg them really hard—

00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:22.791
Don’t write any of these rules down. That’s why this list is blank. 

